## Diagnosis
[2026-10-25 11:37:05 +0700] systemctl is-active curalyta-tunnel: active
  jalur internal: HTTP 200
  log cloudflared:
    2026-10-25T03:33:45Z ERR Register tunnel error from server side error="Unauthorized: Tunnel not found" connIndex=0 event=0 ip=198.41.192.77
    2026-10-25T04:36:52Z ERR Register tunnel error from server side error="Unauthorized: Tunnel not found" connIndex=0 event=0 ip=198.41.200.63
  publik: HTTP 000 (000 = tidak ada respons)
  Akar masalah: quick tunnel Cloudflare bersifat sementara; saat laptop host tidur ±1 jam koneksi
  terputus dan Cloudflare menghapus tunnel. cloudflared terus mencoba ID lama (proses tidak keluar,
  sehingga Restart=always tidak memicu). Layanan inti tetap sehat di jalur internal.

